WEBVTT

00:24:26.522 --> 00:24:30.543
how much does a belief system
matter to a culture,

00:24:30.567 --> 00:24:34.416
and how important is it
that the leader can either embody

00:24:34.440 --> 00:24:37.289
or present the belief system

00:24:37.313 --> 00:24:39.493
in a way that can get people behind it?

00:24:39.517 --> 00:24:41.006
So I think he believed it

00:24:41.030 --> 00:24:44.414
and I definitely believe
he got people to believe it.

00:24:44.438 --> 00:24:47.893
I'm kind of curious for myself

00:24:47.917 --> 00:24:52.941
on how much that mattered
for the incredible things

00:24:52.965 --> 00:24:54.401
that we were able to achieve.

00:24:54.425 --> 00:24:56.266
I think they mattered a lot,

00:24:56.290 --> 00:25:00.758
but I'm curious from your surveying
of companies and founders and CEOs,